  "task": "# Relay stage 1: Ideate\nTask: fix-visual-relay-timing-bug\nWorking directory: /Volumes/Tera/dev/visual-relay/\nProtected paths (queue bookkeeping \u2014 never part of this task's diff): llm-tasks/, .relay/, .relay-scratch/, .swival/\n\n## Task input\n# Fix Visual Relay Timing Bug\n\nWhen the review stage is flagged and another task starts, the visual review stage timer still keeps going. It should stop.\n\n## Manifest\n(not set yet)\n\n## Task context\n### Screenshot 2026-07-15 at 9.37.05\u202fPM.png (387896 bytes, not inlined)\n\n## Prior stages\n\n\nEnd your reply with a single fenced ```json block, nothing after it, matching: { \"summary\": string, \"options\": string[] }",
